    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "Hey!\r\n\r\nFP16 on Pascal GPUs is not supported. More generally compute capability < 70 is not supported, though you can make it work by changing the datatype to fp16 and using block sizes that don't overflow shared memory",
